{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26018","headline":"沛中怀古 · 鲍溶","name":"沛中怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟芜歌风台，此是赤帝乡。\n赤帝今已矣，大风邈凄凉。\n惟昔仗孤劒，十年朝八荒。\n人言生处乐，万乘巡东方。\n高台何巍巍，行殿起中央。\n兴言万代事，四坐沾衣裳。\n我爲异代臣，酌水祀先王。\n抚事复怀昔，临风独彷徨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}